    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5792" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφι-δοξέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be doubtful,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀμφιδοξεῖν</span>”
				<i>room for doubt,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1356a8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					32.16.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
